{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"def8b8457c51f3116900eadb6361bc42c7f814edc149d274dc41792525318cf9","ja":"みんなでシェアしてメニューチェック！","zh":"大家一起分享，看看菜单吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ca7b6b5214535292aada55e98fadbf450d3e26b217fefbc079107fdcbc969f47","ja":"えっ！　ステーキにサラダとパンがついてるのに、\nこんなに安いの！？","zh":"诶！牛排还附带沙拉和面包，\n居然这么便宜吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5de2c01b3718f7634d470cee41c6ebfd60bef18135513aaeaf3402ec0a801ab6","ja":"すごいっしょ？　アタシも前に、値段見てセットだと\n思わなくてさ、追加注文しちゃったんだよね～。","zh":"很厉害吧？我之前看了价格也以为不是套餐，\n结果就加点啦～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"584a3d478ab446b97fd3d3e266256b4b19eeda4b0dd6d00bf4a0035db0a5d217","ja":"そしたら、友達とふたりきりだったのに、\nサラダとパンが4皿ずつきちゃってめっちゃ焦ったよ！","zh":"结果明明只有我和朋友两个人，\n沙拉和面包却各送上来了4盘，真是慌死我了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"96c399477fbc06a39443bea88d9503368b1869b080444a70a3971fbc7fc3bebc","ja":"タブレット注文あるあるだね。\nあとは、つい注文しすぎちゃったりとか！","zh":"平板点餐很常见的情况呢。\n还有就是，不知不觉就会点太多！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1aa28f58fc5cbd80e0340997b59efb2af658231a928c4ce8c994eddb40538771","ja":"そうそう！　で、急きょ他の友達にも来てもらって、\nシェア用に追加注文して……結局食べ過ぎちゃって。","zh":"对对！然后，临时叫了其他朋友过来，\n加点了大家一起分着吃的分量……结果还是吃撑了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6cea00036c9fa83ec8fd4d99e0b29b618eecae4a96be23cdaf25e0422728ef9d","ja":"ふふっ♪　でもわかるなぁ。こうやってみんなで\n食べると、楽しくて食事も進んじゃうし。","zh":"呵呵♪ 不过我懂这种感觉。像这样大家一起\n吃的话，开心得饭量都变大了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f8bc1158a3aa6303384939a31b4e4305ad71710dde684f6dc9d46c3714f3713b","ja":"それにみんな美味しいし！\n茜ちゃんの行きつけにしちゃおっかな！","zh":"而且样样都很好吃！\n要不就把这里当成小茜常去的店吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7e965861b4fd716341bb204e6ffce1245df1de9ab944655ccbb04d87dc6365ee","ja":"でしょでしょ？\nまだいけそう？　もっといろいろ頼んじゃお！","zh":"对吧对吧？\n还能吃得下吗？再点些各种各样的吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3","ja":"数十分後……","zh":"数十分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6b5c20ecb8f3b201d51583f1f3226588e0593d1e84ed59bf230a1ffc39d9b008","ja":"この和風パスタも美味しい～！　けど……\nさすがに、そろそろきつくなってきたかも。","zh":"这份和风意面也好好吃～！　不过……\n说实话，差不多快吃不下了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f4fb7453ea6c3bd7bfe70576120461ac71d28f42fc799c42c5592247f21637ac","ja":"だよね～。でさ、ふたりともどんな感じ？\nコレ！っていうの、見つかった？","zh":"就是说嘛～。话说，你们两个感觉如何？\n找到觉得“就是这个！”的了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3994ac6ef48b0c4b28a63a0c2860cae0b4baf1d6581ef052a6195892d682e89c","ja":"う～ん……いろいろ食べたけど、\n全部美味しくて、簡単に決められないかもな……。","zh":"嗯～……虽然吃了不少样，\n但全都很好吃，感觉很难轻易定下来啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1667.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f69c393e4ea84e30e71525fcf11e11c6fea3b08489d10f76078cf3f170e0d7df","ja":"やっぱ、そうだよね～！\nどうしよっかな～！？","zh":"果然是这样呢～！\n该怎么办好呢～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
